	"Description": "这是龙与冒险团的先发单人mod，伊卡洛雯。\n<br />正常推进流程需要回信，她会在每个节日的当天和前一天出现在探险家公会。\n<br />正常的书信可以加好感，所以你可以猜一猜她喜欢什么。\n<br />\n<br />内涵高清肖像和像素肖像，可以自己切换\n<br />\n<br />如果喜欢的话请支持点赞，后续应该会马上更新，请点击追踪mod\n<br />\n<br />------------机翻\n<br />This is the starting single-character mod for [i]Adventurers &amp; Dragons[/i] — Icaria.\n<br />\n<br />To progress the story normally, you need to reply to her letters. She will appear at the Adventurers' Guild the day before and on the day of every festival.\n<br />\n<br />Normal letters can increase your affection with her, so you can try to guess what she likes.\n<br />\n<br />Includes both high-definition portraits and pixel portraits, which you can switch between freely.\n<br />\n<br />If you enjoy this mod, please support it with a like. more updates coming soon. Please follow the mod.",
